{"about_the_game":"<strong><i>Letzte Worte</i> is an exploration game made for virtual reality that deals with the overcoming of the loss of a loved one.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/932800/extras/fa4e62d9b45a8b272cb5824940d370ba.avif?t=1572536543\" width=616 height=162 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FACE THE SHADOWS OF YOUR PAST</strong></h2>After the death of your brother Leo, you find yourself trapped in a strange shattered world lost in fog. The memories of your past highlight the relationship between you and your brother as well as several events of your common childhood. You have to face your deepest fears in order to come to terms with your loss. <br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore the shattered memories and piece them back together.<br></li><li>Closely examine your surroundings to gain more information about the characters and their stories. <br></li><li>Listen to all tapes and learn more about their common childhood.<br></li><li>Unravel the secret of the suppressed trauma hidden within.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"ac5ee82926e1b0ab7129bacf1c13842bac63d97d.jpg","localized_name":"Snapshots","name":"Snapshots","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/932800/ac5ee82926e1b0ab7129bacf1c13842bac63d97d.jpg"},{"icon":"348e2eaaaa45eedcff6060c1e51372366d4cddeb.jpg","localized_name":"Apartment Viewing","name":"Apartment Viewing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/932800/348e2eaaaa45eedcff6060c1e51372366d4cddeb.jpg"},{"icon":"b31d18cbfa4706751e1df979b0acc04af891bed2.jpg","localized_name":"Hiking Tour","name":"Hiking Tour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/932800/b31d18cbfa4706751e1df979b0acc04af891bed2.jpg"},{"icon":"30aeeceac388335773d4f586ecf9234ac939310f.jpg","localized_name":"Home Sweet Home","name":"Ho